{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>今日（11月4日）一眾歌手盛裝出席《2026年度叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎典禮》記者會，各自以破格造型爭奪傳媒鎂光燈。有人大方展露纖腰搶盡風頭，卻有歌手反其道而行以極端打扮登場。這場猶如時裝騷般華麗較量背後，隱藏著幾位巨星徹底顛覆過往形象驚人舉動。</p>\n<h2>炎明熹破格演繹低胸性感街頭風</h2>\n<p>炎明熹一改過往清純甜美少女形象，以藍黑色低胸抹胸上衣配搭黑色短版外套亮相。她大膽展露纖幼腰線，下身疊穿深灰色格仔百褶短裙與寬鬆工裝長褲。褲身更加入大型口袋及金屬鏈條裝飾，腳踏黑色厚底鞋，面對鏡頭時舉起雙手擺出俏皮姿勢，展示出與平日截然不同破格打扮。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377553232054737_3529078996aead7ad65567.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"叱咤樂壇流行榜 炎明熹 （圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377553232054737_3529078996aead7ad65567.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>康緹穿上絲絨長裙展現高冷魅力</h2>\n<p>康緹挑選了一襲香檳灰啡色絲絨質感吊帶長裙現身，貼身剪裁將纖幼身形表露無遺。裙身採用自然垂墜設計，低調露出肩頸線條與鎖骨，並配襯一雙黑色皮革長手套。她留著一頭烏黑長披肩直髮，面部僅化上清淡自然妝容，全程保持高冷姿態面對傳媒鏡頭。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377830634212457_10398206986aeae282b5c1d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"叱咤樂壇流行榜 炎明熹 （圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377830634212457_10398206986aeae282b5c1d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>IvySo@COLLAR露膊又曬纖腰</h2>\n<p>COLLAR的5位成員全黑上陣，當中蘇雅琳以一身性感街頭打扮現身。她穿著黑色不對稱斜肩短版上衣配搭寬鬆長褲，大方露出腰部線條。上裝特意採用露肩及露腰設計，並以針織冷帽與銀色頸鏈點綴，完全脫離平日在舞台上甜美作風。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377830792125403_5903508176aeae2842f3fe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"叱咤樂壇流行榜 炎明熹 （圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377830792125403_5903508176aeae2842f3fe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Cloud波點連身長裙散發復古氣質</h2>\n<p>Cloud穿上黑色方領無袖波點連身長裙登場，修身剪裁配合自然散開A字裙擺。她特意戴上精緻珍珠頸鏈及黑色毛絨手套作點綴，腳踏一雙黑色尖頭短靴以增加造型層次感。她將一頭長髮整齊束起，加上清雅妝容，全程以端莊姿態參與記者會流程。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377830942219920_21221898006aeae285d3331.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"叱咤樂壇流行榜 炎明熹 （圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377830942219920_21221898006aeae285d3331.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>女團VIVA黑白造型盡顯青春活力</h2>\n<p>4位VIVA成員齊以黑白色系戰衣上陣，各自演繹不同獨特風格。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377831074130247_16943902876aeae2873768e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"叱咤樂壇流行榜 炎明熹 （圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377831074130247_16943902876aeae2873768e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>張天穎短版西裝配高開衩裙搶鏡</h2>\n<p>張天穎大膽穿上黑色低胸上衣及深灰色短版西裝外套，直接展露腹部線條。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377831462759583_19505966306aeae28ae01c4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"叱咤樂壇流行榜 炎明熹 （圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377831462759583_19505966306aeae28ae01c4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>陳曉東鮮黃針織毛衣超搶鏡</h2>\n<p>陳曉東以極度搶眼鮮黃色針織毛衣現身，寬鬆毛衣內搭深色高領上衣及簡約黑色長褲，造成強烈色彩視覺衝擊。他更戴上紅色鏡片太陽眼鏡並留有一頭啡色側分短髮，在一眾深色打扮歌手中突圍而出。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377831594450206_8761752956aeae28c2fadc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"叱咤樂壇流行榜 炎明熹 （圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377831594450206_8761752956aeae28c2fadc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>湯令山極簡休閒打扮離奇變保安</h2>\n<p>湯令山身穿黑色短袖T恤及深灰色牛仔褲，打扮極度低調。他以淺啡色短髮配搭窄框黑色太陽眼鏡，神情非常淡定。這身毫無華麗修飾休閒造型令他看起來宛如現場維持秩序保安員，大批網民紛紛留言笑指：「差啲認唔出佢係歌手，以為係實Q」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377831690755704_6952953566aeae28d34eeb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"叱咤樂壇流行榜 炎明熹 （圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377831690755704_6952953566aeae28d34eeb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>男團JFYT深沉色系展現日系街頭風</h2>\n<p>JFYT的6位成員連同幕後成員含爺齊集紅地氈，眾人一致選用黑色、啡色及灰色等深色系服飾亮相！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377831820048810_13592773876aeae28e816dd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"叱咤樂壇流行榜 炎明熹 （圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377831820048810_13592773876aeae28e816dd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:05:37.430414+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1590,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:45:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:58:55.907648+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:58:45.010781+00:00","content_hash":"1b9255d0aa8968f52d1a7e65114369f3a85f47b4e3585babd615567c832179de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}